  "final": "I fixed the invoice IDOR in `invoicer/handlers/invoices.py`. `get_invoice` and `update_invoice` looked invoices up by `id` alone, so any authenticated user could read or edit another tenant's invoice. Both queries now also filter on `tenant_id = user[\"tenant_id\"]`. A cross-tenant request now returns 404, the same as a missing invoice, so it doesn't reveal that the ID exists.\n\nThe 11 existing tests pass (run with `unittest`, since pytest isn't installed). I didn't add a test for the cross-tenant case.\n\n`list_invoices`, `create_invoice` and the reports query were already scoped to the tenant. I didn't check `handlers/admin.py`.",
